                "text": "We must take stronger action to stop the dangerous spread of counterfeit drugs and hold bad actors accountable. As co-founder of the Domestic Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Caucus, I believe the best way to protect patients and ensure safety is by increasing the production of essential medications right here in the U.S. I\u2019m committed to advancing this critical priority.\nhttps://t.co/6Towg1AyOA",
