                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Rural Healthcare Transformation Fund\u2014signed into law as part of the One Big Beautiful Bill\u2014is a game-changer.  I\u2019m looking forward to seeing Florida\u2019s application and how this landmark program will be utilized locally to strengthen rural hospitals and expand care for vulnerable patients throughout our community.",
