                "text": "The SUPPORT for Patients and Communities Reauthorization Act is now law! This vital legislation takes major steps to reduce the devastating impact of illicit fentanyl and fentanyl-related substances on our communities. It helps first responders, expands recovery resources, and increases access to treatment options for individuals with substance use disorders.",
